tlook and Teams worldwide, with reports from scores of countries and territories.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Darth Vader strikes back at auction as his lightsaber from two original Star Wars films reclaims the record from Luke Skywalker's prop</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a3b92700e05b75ef9fe6a97c68fd536b83b90f6dfe674039733b84f825e24278</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:17Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T02:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/darth-vader-strikes-back-at-auction-as-his-lightsaber-from-two-original-star-wars-films-reclaims-the/a-79935960--81f69e9d2499.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/darth-vader-strikes-back-at-auction-as-his-lightsaber-from-two-original-star-wars-films-reclaims-the-record-from-luke-skywalker-s-prop/a-79935960?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Darth Vader's lightsaber sold for nearly $5 million, breaking the record set by Luke Skywalker's in July. The hilt, made from a 1950s camera flash attachment, was used in two of the original trilogy's duels.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>FIFA loses bid to block UEFA evidence gathering against Infantino</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:830c6266e59d9eef5f608feaab0906e6a2daeff9053afd77bfc52a658fd14245</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:19Z</updated><published>2026-11-13T00:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/fifa-loses-bid-to-block-uefa-evidence-gathering-against-infantino/a-79935807--1a1ba793a2d8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/fifa-loses-bid-to-block-uefa-evidence-gathering-against-infantino/a-79935807?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A New York judge has dismissed soccer governing body FIFA's attempts to shield its president from investigation. Europe's UEFA is seeking evidence of wrongdoing by Gianni Infantino.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU leaders tussle over whom to send to Ukraine, Russia peace talks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b21d005001380fc00cc6d3955e322000bf1adf70895186acda349a884cd74350</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:22Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T22:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-leaders-tussle-over-whom-to-send-to-ukraine-russia-peace-talks/a-79935468--127d08162dcd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-leaders-tussle-over-whom-to-send-to-ukraine-russia-peace-talks/a-79935468?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A seat at the table for Europe now appears likely following comments by a US envoy who just held talks with Putin. But who will take that seat remains unclear.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Pete Hegseth honors soldier who scolded him at Arlington cemetery</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa10ad61cdedbd7a742718dc5f9797a2591e7ab182a225aceb55e108ef5f4553</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:25Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T19:07:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/pete-hegseth-honors-soldier-who-scolded-him-at-arlington-cemetery/a-79935075--c47ceedad120.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/pete-hegseth-honors-soldier-who-scolded-him-at-arlington-cemetery/a-79935075?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The soldier had reprimanded the US Defense Secretary and his group after they were heard talking and laughing at the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier. The site is one of the most solemn military memorials in the US.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria: Axe-wielding men attack opposition campaign rally in Lagos</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8ca4ad2ac65122bd144293be254a09bea9e7bfaf85af0a4e4bd5bf031fa2769a</id><updated>2026-11-13T06:59:28Z</updated><published>2026-11-12T19:01:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-axe-wieldin